WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:04.300
Use your hands to zoom in and out.

00:04.400 --> 00:07.600
I can point: “Add five stickies here.”

00:09.400 --> 00:11.900
Grab them, throw them around.

00:12.800 --> 00:15.400
I can point: “Make this green.”

00:17.700 --> 00:19.400
“Make this green.”

00:19.800 --> 00:23.800
Because I’m talking to you, it’s a bit silly, right?

00:24.600 --> 00:27.000
“Add five stickies here.”

00:27.400 --> 00:29.800
“Make this red.”

00:30.000 --> 00:31.900
“Make this blue.”

00:32.100 --> 00:33.800
“Delete.”

00:34.100 --> 00:38.400
You know, I can throw them around, give it a bit of physics,

00:38.600 --> 00:42.600
have a bit of fun with it. Zoom in, out.
